{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JsAwecypTX1794977033.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「東張女神」鄧凱文向來樣靚身材正，不時在社交網分享靚相大派福利。日前她再上載一輯最新戶外寫真靚相，大晒白滑香肩與一雙逆天長腿，令一眾網民睇到心心眼！</p><p><p><img alt=\"thm____1794908205_4032303659621368275_198790958.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AHUmK8gDPU1794977034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>從曝光的相片可見，鄧凱文扎起清爽甜美的丸子頭，身穿低胸吊帶背心大晒迷人鎖骨，下身則配搭一條白色荷葉邊超短褲，造型既具青春活力又不失小性感。她在鏡頭前大擺多個迷人甫士，將一雙白滑修長的無敵美腿表露無遺。</p><p><p><img alt=\"thm____1794908205_4032303653732694872_198790958.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XDu8tS7s9T1794977034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>其後她又移師至海邊岩石上取景，側身坐在大石上對着鏡頭露出甜美微笑，在柔和海風與天色襯托下，散發出滿滿的仙氣！一輯靚相曝光後火速引來大批網民洗版激讚，紛紛留言大呼：「東張女神果然名不虛傳」、「好養眼」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.194072+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.252721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:52.905237+00:00","content_hash":"23283ab350a88006073cf9e82c4ead7cd6a03b725a5897f3a408840beda682d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.194072+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}